  m_Name: Cerberus
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  objectName: CERBERUS
  description: "<color=orange>CLASS: LESSER DEMON\n\nDATA:</color>\nAlthough they do not resemble the mythological three-headed dog, this name was chosen due to their nature as protectors of Hell. However, it's not yet known why some stay dormant despite provocation. \n\nDespite the fact that keeping an energy orb stable takes a considerable amount of focus and effort, they seem to always keep one in hand, most likely as a display of their power to scare off intruders.\n\n<color=orange>STRATEGY:</color>\n- Due to remaining entirely stationary until awoken, they move quite slowly, but the stone-like exterior provides good protection against even powerful attacks.\n\n- They're quite adept at throwing, but their slow movement makes it easy to break line of sight for extended periods of time.\n\n- Their large size makes them an ample target for both headshots and imprecise attacks."
  gameObject: {fileID: 1709254077376921, guid: 871f993532d6c1d42b9dc142663288a7, type: 2}
